<table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Mar 26, 2004 :: Holy Crap am I a slacker!</div><p>Finally.. finally! We find Manaetic Behemoth up AND get there before anyone else. No pictures were taken, of course, since he doesn't get to live long. Edit: I lied, Parn took a picture as we were setting up. <br /><br /><img alt="" hspace="0" src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/mb_01.jpg" align="baseline" border="0" /></p><p>Loot grats to Kleria on <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/coil_twisted_platinum_wire.jpeg">Coil of Twisted Platinum Wire</a> and Vaea on <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/glowing_steel_shim.jpg">Glowing Steel Shim</a>!  </p><p>Grats Dawneylee on completing your <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/rpics/nature_walkers_scimitar.jpg">Nature Walker's Scimitar</a>!<br />Grats Shatta on completing your <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/fpics/water_sprinkler_of_nem_ankh.jpg">Water Sprinkler of Nem Ankh</a>!</p><p>Grats Haitful on 65 and Fury, our first Fury in the guild!<br />Lots of other level updates I've missed.. will try to fill in here. Apologies to those not listed.. I still love you!</p><p>Some raid loots since the last time I updated. <br />Zelcon on <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/fpics/tunic_of_the_khati_sha.jpg">Tunic of Khati Sha</a>!<br />Schena and Tellie on <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/glowingorbofthestormwatcher.jpg">Glowing Orb of the Stormwatcher</a>!<br />Sindall on <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/cap_drowned_souls.jpg">Cap of Drowned Souls</a>!<br />Tempys on <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/stormriders_signet.jpg">Stormrider's Signet</a>!<br />Kelnya on <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/rpics/gargoyle_talon.jpg">Gargoyle Talon</a>! (thanks RD who didn't need for letting him come loot it)<br />Reide and Grajin on <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/Mantle_of_the_Rainmaker.jpg">Mantle of the Rainmaker</a>!<br />Lushissx on the greed roll for Plate Ornate Breastplate Mold!<br />Dorina on the greed roll for Ornate Leather Tunic pattern!<br />Balut on the greed roll for Ornate Chain Tunic pattern!<br />Colwn on <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/fpics/greatstaff_of_the_four_winds.jpg">Greatstaff of the Four Winds</a>! <br />Grellk on <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/blackbladeoftherain.jpe">Blackblade of the Rain</a> and <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/Twice_Forged_Steel_Bulwark.gif">Twice Forged Steel Bulwark</a>!<br />Arwa on <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics17/talisman_burrower.gif">Talisman of the Burrower</a>!<br />Emmajo on <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics18/Wormhusk_Harness.jpg">Wormhusk Harness</a>!</p><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Jul 4, 2004</p></td></tr></table><p /><span class="page-scroll">Pages:  1 </span></td>
			<td class="panel-cell"><!-- Right Panel Cell -->
				<div class="headlines">
<a href=news.asp?newsid=620><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/manaetic_behemoth.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Mar 26</b></a> - Manetic Behemoth and Cap!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=612><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/althumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Feb 29</b></a> - Flawless Victory!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=611><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/adthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Feb 28</b></a> - Aerin'Dar, dragon o' pally loot!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=605><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/grummthumb.gif border=0 width=125><br><b>Feb 1</b></a> - I'm bigger than you.. I'm higher on the food chain!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=602><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/littleterry.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Jan 24</b></a> - Terris Thule Naptime!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=575><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/dainthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Nov 22</b></a> - Dain Frostreaver's Feet!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=563><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/yelinak.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Nov 8</b></a> - Lord Yelinak!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=562><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/stthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Nov 7</b></a> - Visit to Sleeper's Tomb<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=560><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/tormaxthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Nov 5</b></a> - The King is Dead!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=547><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/vpthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Oct 26</b></a> - Veeshan's Peak cleared!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=543><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/narandithumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Oct 21</b></a> - Mahrsan gets his 10th Ring, and we get to have a war!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=542><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/lendthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Oct 18</b></a> - Keep this, beotch! And Sont too..<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=524><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/zlandthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Oct 3</b></a> - Zland and Kland go down... naughty..<p>
